       91       field regID           as character format "X(21)"
       92       field inn             as character
       93       field kpp             as character
       94       field country         as character
       95       field regionCode      as character
       96       field district        as character
       97       field city            as character
       98       field settlement      as character
       99       field street          as character
      100       field house-number    as character
